{"id":"vod_md_3129","vodId":"3129","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"男子高中生的日常","name_cn":"男子高中生的日常","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/8d2ead4d67c9327c69bee7bd14512f3d.jpg"},"summary":"《男子高中生的日常》以真田北男校为舞台，围绕着主角忠邦（入野自由 配音），以及他的死党秀则（杉田智和 配音）和吉竹（铃村健一 配音）的日常高中生活而展开。忠邦主要担任吐槽的角色，长相中性的他常常被秀则和吉竹联合欺负。登场人物还有同校学生会的元治、唐泽、副会长和会长等人，这是一群基本上没有女朋友的男校学生，在鲜有女生参与的情况下，展开了插科打诨的日常高中生活。这是一部搞笑向的作品，内容短小，笑点十足。动画以每集一个小故事的节奏，采用“男子高中生与XX”的标题形式，将男子高中生的爆笑日常故事呈现给观众。本作根据山内泰延的同名漫画《男子高中生的日常》改编而成。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-24 08:48:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/k2zR4OjZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/naHGZSdb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/XiaT7l6v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/z8Uh5aLF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/GQVXrwq6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/V94mSPHM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/EXeYM0UF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/YHtywDvA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/6vTvXXQE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/xkAyu7RV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/w8Ihvirp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/KxyKq6UE/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:51.782Z"}